1
00:00:00,084 --> 00:00:01,484
(Howard:)Hey, Raj, what's up?

2
00:00:01,719 --> 00:00:04,619
(Raj:)You were right. I can't get out of here.

3
00:00:05,489 --> 00:00:08,149
- You're still at my mother's?
- I'm trapped.

4
00:00:08,359 --> 00:00:11,519
(Raj:)My clothes have been in the laundry
all day, and she hid my keys.

5
00:00:11,762 --> 00:00:15,962
(Raj:)I think they might be in her bra
because she jingles when she walks.

6
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:17,660
(Raj:)What do I do?

7
00:00:17,868 --> 00:00:20,838
(Howard:)Hey, you wanted a woman in your life,
now you got one.

8
00:00:21,539 --> 00:00:23,239
(Raj:)Come on, Howard, help me.

9
00:00:23,441 --> 00:00:27,271
Rajesh, tatellah, I ran you a bath!

10
00:00:27,778 --> 00:00:32,048
(Raj:)Oh, my God,
she's not gonna bathe me, is she?

11
00:00:35,052 --> 00:00:38,022
(Howard:)Gee, I wish I could tell you no.

12
00:00:42,193 --> 00:00:44,493
(Howard:)All right, well, thanks again
for helping me out.

13
00:00:44,662 --> 00:00:46,182
(Scene:)Howard...

14
00:00:46,764 --> 00:00:51,034
- Should we go back and rescue him?
- Too late. We'll see him at his bar mitzvah.

15
00:00:53,971 --> 00:00:54,991
(Sheldon:)Here you go.

16
00:00:55,206 --> 00:00:58,406
(Amy:)I picked up the Chinese food
just the way Leonard used to.

